      "content": "i feel like i've hit a wall. like, a permanent one. i look at my new work and it just feels... hollow. like a cheap imitation of what i used to be. i used to have this fire, but now it's just gone and i'm just waiting for everyone to realize i'm a fraud. i don't want to keep going just to watch myself get worse and worse until i'm a joke.",
